# Raw upstream snapshots are kept LOCAL and re-fetchable, not committed.
#
# A/ (nathans/lxx-swete) and B/ (OpenGreekAndLatin/First1KGreek) are bulk
# checkouts fetched by fetch.mjs. They are pinned by commit SHA and verified
# by SHA-256 in A-manifest.json and B-manifest.json; those manifests ARE
# committed as the auditable record, so the exact sources stay reproducible
# without publishing the raw caches.
#
# Run `node build/sources/lxx-swete/fetch.mjs` to (re)create A/ and B/.
A/
B/
